{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"DEU","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"申命记","commonName":"申命记","title":"申命记","order":5,"numberOfChapters":34,"sha256":"8bcef4291eceeae7f82fc249330b10c87bbadfbb92c93565cfd900e5b52a2379","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DEU/1.json","lastChapterNumber":34,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DEU/34.json","totalNumberOfVerses":949},"chapter":{"number":32,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["摩西之歌"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"“诸天啊，请听我说；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"大地啊，请听我言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿我的教导如雨降下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愿我的话语如露滴落，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像水滴滋润嫩草，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像甘霖浇灌草木。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要宣扬耶和华的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要颂赞我们上帝的伟大。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"“祂是磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂的作为完美，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂按公义行事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂信实可靠，公平正直。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"狡诈、堕落的一代啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们却对祂不忠，行事败坏，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不配做祂的儿女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"愚昧无知的人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们就这样报答耶和华吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂是你们的父，你们的创造主，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂创造了你们，塑造了你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"“要回顾往昔，追溯历史；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"问你们的父亲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必回答你们；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"问你们的长者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必告诉你们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"当初，至高者赐万国产业，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把人类分开，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂依照天使","poem":1},{"noteId":7},{"text":"的数目，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为万族定疆界。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但以色列人属于耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各是祂的产业。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"“在荒凉的旷野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在野兽吼叫的荒野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华找到他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"庇护他们，看顾他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"保护他们如同保护眼中的瞳仁，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又如老鹰搅动窝巢，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"盘旋在雏鹰之上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"展开双翼接住它们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背着他们飞翔。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华独自带领他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"没有外族神明同在。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华使他们驰骋在大地的高处，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃田间的五谷，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"磐石中的蜂蜜，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"石头地产的油；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吃牛酪和羊奶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"肥美的羔羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"巴珊的绵羊和山羊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"上好的麦子；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喝葡萄汁酿的酒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"“但耶书仑","poem":1},{"noteId":8},{"text":"吃饱喝足，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"养肥长壮后，就得意忘形，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"背弃造他们的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"藐视救他们的磐石。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们拜外族的神明，令祂愤恨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"行可憎之事，惹祂发怒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们祭拜的不是真神，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而是鬼魔，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是他们素不认识的新神明，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是他们祖先所不敬畏的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们轻视生他们的磐石，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"忘记养他们的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"“耶和华看见祂儿女的恶行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就愤然厌弃他们，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"说，‘这堕落的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不忠的儿女！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要掩面不理他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看他们的结局如何。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们拜假神，让我愤恨；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"供虚无之物，惹我发怒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要借无名之民挑起他们的嫉妒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用愚昧的国民激起他们的怒气。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的怒火已经点燃，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要烧到阴间的尽头，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"吞灭大地及其出产，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"甚至烧毁山的根基。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"text":"“‘我要使灾祸连连临到他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的箭都射向他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必饱受饥荒之苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被瘟疫和灾祸吞噬，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被猛兽和毒蛇袭击。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"外有刀剑杀戮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"内有恐惧笼罩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"男女老幼无不丧命。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我本要消灭他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使世人忘记他们；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":27,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但我怕敌人夸口，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"误以为这是他们的胜利，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"而非我的作为。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":28,"content":[{"text":"“以色列人愚昧无知，毫无见识。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":29,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如果他们有智慧，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就能明白这一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"知道自己的结局。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":30,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不是他们的磐石卖掉他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"若不是耶和华抛弃他们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"一人怎能赶散他们千人？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"二人怎能击溃他们万人？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":31,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我们的敌人也承认他们的磐石不如我们的磐石。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":32,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们犹如来自所多玛、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"长在蛾摩拉的葡萄树，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"结的葡萄粒粒有毒，串串苦涩；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":33,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"酿的酒如蛇的毒液，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如眼镜蛇的毒液。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":34,"content":[{"text":"“祂说，‘我把这一切积存起来，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"封在我的仓库里。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":35,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"申冤在我，我必报应，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"到时候他们必站不住脚，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们遭祸的日子近了，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的末日快要来了。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":36,"content":[{"text":"“耶和华见自己的子民力量衰竭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"奴隶和自由人所剩无几，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必为他们主持公道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"怜悯祂的仆人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":37,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂必说，‘你们的神明在哪里？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"庇护你们的磐石在哪里？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":38,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"它们吃你们祭牲的脂肪，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"喝你们的奠酒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"让它们起来帮助你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"庇护你们吧！","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":39,"content":[{"text":"“‘你们现今要知道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯有我是上帝；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除我之外，别无他神。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我掌管生死，我打伤、我医治；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人能逃出我的掌心。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":40,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我向天伸手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"凭我的永恒起誓，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":41,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要磨快闪亮的剑，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"主持公道，报应仇敌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"惩罚恨我的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":42,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使我的箭饱饮鲜血，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是被杀被掳之人的血；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的剑要吞噬人肉，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是敌人将领的肉。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":43,"content":[{"text":"“列邦啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们当与祂的子民一同欢乐！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为祂要为自己的仆人报血仇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"报应祂的仇敌，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"洁净祂的土地和子民。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":44,"content":["摩西和嫩的儿子约书亚把这首诗歌读给会众听。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["摩西的遗嘱"]},{"type":"verse","number":45,"content":["读完后，摩西又对以色列人说："]},{"type":"verse","number":46,"content":["“要谨记我今天警告你们的话，要吩咐你们的子孙谨遵这律法上的一切话。"]},{"type":"verse","number":47,"content":["这律法不是空话，而是你们的生命。你们若遵守这律法，就必长住在约旦河西岸你们将要占领的土地上。”"]},{"type":"heading","content":["预言摩西的死"]},{"type":"verse","number":48,"content":["当天，耶和华对摩西说："]},{"type":"verse","number":49,"content":["“你去耶利哥对面的摩押，登上亚巴琳山区的尼波山，观看我要赐给以色列人作产业的迦南。"]},{"type":"verse","number":50,"content":["之后，你会死在那山上，归到你祖先那里，如你哥哥亚伦在何珥山离世归祖一样。"]},{"type":"verse","number":51,"content":["因为在荀旷野，在加低斯的米利巴泉旁，你和亚伦对我不忠，没有在以色列人中尊我为圣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":52,"content":["所以，你只能远远地观看我要赐给以色列人的土地，却不能进去。”"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"“天使”希伯来文是“以色列的儿子”。","reference":{"chapter":32,"verse":8}},{"noteId":8,"caller":"+","text":"“耶书仑”是以色列的昵称。","reference":{"chapter":32,"verse":15}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DEU/32.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DEU/33.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/DEU/31.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":52}